{"name":"Hlaungadath","status":"ok","title":"Hlaungadath","pageId":18698,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"dablink\" style=\"padding-left:2em;\"><i>This article is about city in <a href=\"/wiki/Netheril\" title=\"Netheril\">Netheril</a>. For the <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvT2FzaXM/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Oasis (page does not exist)\">oasis</span> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Anauroch\" title=\"Anauroch\">Anauroch</a> desert, see <a href=\"/wiki/Hlaunga\" title=\"Hlaunga\">Hlaunga</a>.</i></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\"><nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_Hlaungadath\" title=\"Category:Maps of Hlaungadath\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Hlaungadath</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Anaur-p63_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Anaur-p63-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS-p102_2-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS-p102-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-ATEoS-p135_3-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ATEoS-p135-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ruins, <small><b>Formerly:</b></small> settlement</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frozen_Sea\" title=\"Frozen Sea\">Frozen Sea</a>, northwestern <a href=\"/wiki/Anauroch\" title=\"Anauroch\">Anauroch</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lamia\" title=\"Lamia\">Lamias</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Asabi\" title=\"Asabi\">asabi</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gargoyle\" title=\"Gargoyle\">gargoyles</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Manticore\" title=\"Manticore\">manticores</a> c. <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Condemn-p22-23_4-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Condemn-p22-23-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS-p102_2-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS-p102-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6SW5oYWJpdGFudHNfb2ZfSGxhdW5nYWRhdGg/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Hlaungadath (page does not exist)\">Inhabitants of  Hlaungadath</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6TG9jYXRpb25zX2luX0hsYXVuZ2FkYXRoP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Category:Locations in Hlaungadath (page does not exist)\">Locations in  Hlaungadath</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6T3JnYW5pemF0aW9uc19pbl9IbGF1bmdhZGF0aD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Hlaungadath (page does not exist)\">Organizations in  Hlaungadath</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Hlaungadath</b> was a ruined former flying city of <a href=\"/wiki/Netheril\" title=\"Netheril\">Netheril</a> lying in the desert of northwestern <a href=\"/wiki/Anauroch\" title=\"Anauroch\">Anauroch</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Anaur-p63_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Anaur-p63-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS-p102_2-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS-p102-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-ATEoS-p135_3-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ATEoS-p135-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> The city landed near the <a href=\"/wiki/High_Ice\" title=\"High Ice\">High Ice</a> and was eventually abandoned,<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-PoALPaH_5-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-PoALPaH-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> but the ruins remained largely intact.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS-p102_2-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS-p102-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-ATEoS-p135_3-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ATEoS-p135-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Description\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Description</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Notable_Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Locations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Legends_&amp;_Rumors\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Legends &amp; Rumors</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Further_Reading\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Further Reading</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Connections\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Connections</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Hlaungadath?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It was some 40 to 50 miles from the <a href=\"/wiki/Nether_Mountains\" title=\"Nether Mountains\">Nether Mountains</a>, east of <a href=\"/wiki/Ascore\" title=\"Ascore\">Ascore</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Frozen_Sea\" title=\"Frozen Sea\">Frozen Sea</a> south of the High Ice.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Condemn-p1-3_6-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Condemn-p1-3-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS-p102_2-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS-p102-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Hlaungadath was the destination of a hidden portal in the <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRGFuZ2xpbmdfVG93ZXI/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Dangling Tower (page does not exist)\">Dangling Tower</span> in <a href=\"/wiki/Ched_Nasad\" title=\"Ched Nasad\">Ched Nasad</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Condemn-p1-3_6-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Condemn-p1-3-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>A two-way portal in Hlaungadath designed for travel to the dwarven city <a href=\"/wiki/Ascore\" title=\"Ascore\">Ascore</a> had additional keys to a destination in the now ruins of <a href=\"/wiki/Anauria\" title=\"Anauria\">Anauria</a>, to a site in the <a href=\"/wiki/High_Moor\" title=\"High Moor\">High Moor</a> that was once within the elven kingdom of <a href=\"/wiki/Miyeritar\" title=\"Miyeritar\">Miyeritar</a>, to a tree in northern <a href=\"/wiki/Myth_Drannor\" title=\"Myth Drannor\">Myth Drannor</a>, and to the <a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Plane\" title=\"Astral Plane\">Astral Plane</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-PoALPaH_5-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-PoALPaH-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Description\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Hlaungadath?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Description\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Hlaungadath's architecture was clearly <a href=\"/wiki/Netherese\" title=\"Netherese\">Netherese</a>, with square column bases and pointed arched windows.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Condemn-p22-23_4-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Condemn-p22-23-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> The city was filled with sand-covered ruined domes, colonnades, ramparts, and towers.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Condemn-p1-3_6-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Condemn-p1-3-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-PoALPaH_5-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-PoALPaH-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Hlaungadath?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The ruins of the city were inhabited by <a href=\"/wiki/Lamia\" title=\"Lamia\">lamias</a> with their thralls: <a href=\"/wiki/Manticore\" title=\"Manticore\">manticores</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Asabi\" title=\"Asabi\">asabi</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Gargoyle\" title=\"Gargoyle\">gargoyles</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Condemn-p31_7-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Condemn-p31-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Locations\">Notable Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Hlaungadath?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Ruins of the High Hall of Justice: On the facade there was still text in <a href=\"/wiki/Netherese_language\" title=\"Netherese language\">Netherese</a> meaning \"In Truth's Light No Lies Abide.\"<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Condemn-p22-23_4-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Condemn-p22-23-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Legends_.26_Rumors\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Legends_&amp;_Rumors\">Legends &amp; Rumors</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Legends &amp; Rumors\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Hlaungadath?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Legends &amp; Rumors\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Bedine\" title=\"Bedine\">Bedine</a> believed some kind of evil lived in the place, and over the years multiple tribes occupied then abandoned it due to the evil they found in their dreams but could not describe.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-PoALPaH_5-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-PoALPaH-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Hlaungadath?veaction=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"metadata plainlinks stub\"><tbody><tr>\n<td><i>This article is incomplete.</i> <i>You can help the Forgotten Realms Wiki by providing more information.</i></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appearances\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Hlaungadath?veaction=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Appearances\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>Novels</dt>\n<dd><i><a href=\"/wiki/Condemnation\" title=\"Condemnation\">Condemnation</a></i></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Further_Reading\">Further Reading</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Further Reading\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Hlaungadath?veaction=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Further Reading\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a> (November 1991). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Anauroch_(sourcebook)\" title=\"Anauroch (sourcebook)\">Anauroch</a></i>. Edited by <a href=\"/wiki/Karen_S._Boomgarden\" title=\"Karen S. Boomgarden\">Karen S. Boomgarden</a>. (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc.\" title=\"TSR, Inc.\">TSR, Inc.</a>). ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/1-56076-126-1\" title=\"Special:BookSources/1-56076-126-1\">1-56076-126-1</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Greg_A._Vaughan\" title=\"Greg A. Vaughan\">Greg A. Vaughan</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Skip_Williams\" title=\"Skip Williams\">Skip Williams</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Thomas_M._Reid\" title=\"Thomas M. Reid\">Thomas M. Reid</a> (November 2007). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Anauroch:_The_Empire_of_Shade\" title=\"Anauroch: The Empire of Shade\">Anauroch: The Empire of Shade</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>). ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-4362-9\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-4362-9\">0-7869-4362-9</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Robert_Wiese\" title=\"Robert Wiese\">Robert Wiese</a> (2003-06-04). <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030704022153/http://wizards.com:80/default.asp?x=dnd/pg/20030604a\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">“<i>Portals</i> of Anauroch: The Lost <i>Portal</i> at Hlaungadath”</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Perilous_Gateways\" title=\"Perilous Gateways\">Perilous Gateways</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>. Archived from <a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://archive.wizards.com/default.asp?x=dnd/pg/20030604a\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">the original</a> on 2003-07-04. Retrieved on 2016-07-16.</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/James_Butler\" title=\"James Butler\">James Butler</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Elizabeth_T._Danfor